## Findings — all four are walk_truth coverage holes, all fixed

F1  west back-of-house rooms, x 344-500 / y 63-103 (183 m^2), probe (420,82)
    -> blocked, drawn-closed room, inner wall x=500 with the staff door
    swing at (501,83). Evidence: crop z_nw, drawn-sealed patch list.
    Truth: must never be walkable. Fix: walk_truth `must_not` [420,82].
    Was the largest sealed staff area in the store with no guard point.

F2  front-end block, x 597-889 / y 612-649 (153 m^2), probe (740,630)
    -> blocked, enclosed room behind the checkstands with one door swing
    at (850,609). Evidence: crop z_frontend. Truth: must never be
    walkable. Fix: walk_truth `must_not` [740,630].

F3  Lease tenant unit, x 955-985 / y 578-640, probe (968,605) -> blocked.
    walk_truth guarded only the adjacent Admin office at (1040,610), so
    the western half of the 1598-cell SE culled pocket was unguarded.
    Evidence: crop ov_22 / z_pharm. Fix: walk_truth `must_not` [968,605].

F4  `must` coverage: nine wings/sections had no must point at all —
    Market NW, Beer/Wine, Frozen Foods, Apparel, the Seasonal column,
    Baby/aisle 46, the **Cosmetics east frontage strip**, Meal Simple and
    the Business Center customer frontage. The Cosmetics case is the
    store-24 geometry exactly: a wing whose only frontage is the 8-18 pt
    strip x 1078-1086 between the aisle 47-51 shelf ends and the east
    wall (verified continuous, y 434-486). Fix: walk_truth `must`
    [425,190], [510,192], [875,200], [895,300], [872,460], [1010,360],
    [1080,465], [511,583], [600,600].

All original 21 must / 19 must_not points re-probed: every one passes AND
lands inside the feature it names (checked against the exclusion, staff,
seal-rect, fixture and boundary masks — not merely in an adjacent
frontage). Fix type for every finding above: walk_truth point. No
inclusion, exclusion or seal_zones override was needed; no code, golden
or other store was touched.

After the fix: `./rebuild.sh 108` exit 0, `verify: []`, both coverage
lists empty, components n=1 [54128], walkable_pct 20.5, 774 passed.

AUDIT CLEAN — store 108 (4 findings fixed)
